  {recorded.roster?<div className='cos-fleet-count-note'><details><summary>Recorded source and count details</summary><p>Combined COS roster: {scope.length+sourceScope.length} assignment representations in these filters · {scope.length} linked COS units · {sourceScope.length} unlinked or identity-review records.</p><p>The physical mHelpDesk inventory shown above is a separate count. Combined recorded Field representations in this view: {counts.field}. Health totals cover linked units only; missing GPS does not remove recorded Field equipment.</p><p>In this view: {mhelpRecordsInScope} MHelp product records represented · {trackerOnlyInScope} tracker-only equipment records. Source assignments are recorded evidence, not live GPS. Cross-source links are reviewed; complete physical deduplication is still pending. Across the full roster, {recorded.roster.summary.review} active records need placement or identity review.</p>{(map as any)?.uploadInventory&&<p>MHelp export received {cameraTime((map as any).uploadInventory.receivedAt,cameras.now)} (minute precision); export as-of time was not supplied. 2027 tracker read {cameraTime((map as any).uploadInventory.trackerSource?.observedAt,cameras.now)}.</p>}<p>Placement, family, provider, search and location filters apply to the summary; the health filter applies to the list and map. Assignment times are also shown in equipment details.</p></details></div>:<p className='cos-fleet-count-note'>Summary: {scope.length} units in the selected placement, family, provider, search and location filters; the health status filter applies to the list and map. {scope.filter(row=>row.support).length} support units have 0 cameras. Pins count only field units with verified or labeled estimate coordinates. Health totals count units using camera / connection evidence, not individual cameras. Camera Health groups provider resources; TV totals use field units.</p>}
  {view==='map'&&<details className='field-map-info cos-fleet-map-info'><summary>Map info &amp; review{map?.placementReviews?.length?' · '+map.placementReviews.length+' placement records to review':''}</summary><p>{rows.filter(r=>r.placement==='field'&&r.locationVerified).length} verified map pins. Status and location verification are separate.</p><p>Saved camera health refreshes every 4 minutes while visible; router and power reads refresh every 15 minutes. Health data read {cameraTime(cameras.data?.refreshedAt,cameras.now)}; source observation times are shown in unit details.</p><p>Camera-capable units with missing, stale or unmatched evidence remain unverified. Support units have 0 cameras and stay outside camera totals. Recorder and service observations do not establish individual camera outages.</p><p>Online observations: {onlineBasis.camera} camera / detector, {onlineBasis.recorder} recorder, {onlineBasis.connection} IP / port. These observations do not verify video or complete camera coverage.</p><p>Offline observations: {offlineBasis.camera} camera / detector, {offlineBasis.recorder} recorder, {offlineBasis.connection} IP / port. Recorder and service outages do not establish individual camera outages.</p><p>EST: address estimate · SRC: tracker-recorded coordinates. Estimates and historical coordinates are excluded from nearby distances.</p>{Boolean(map?.placementReviews?.length)&&<section aria-label='Placement records needing review'><h3>Placement needs review ({map!.placementReviews.length})</h3><p>These units remain in inventory. Pins stay held until the unit mapping is resolved.</p><ul>{map!.placementReviews.filter((row:any)=>!filters.query||[row.unitNumber,row.reason].some(value=>String(value).toLowerCase().includes(filters.query.toLowerCase()))).map((row:any,index:number)=><li key={row.unitNumber+'-'+index}><strong>{row.unitNumber}</strong> · {row.reason} <a href={'../../camera-health.html?q='+encodeURIComponent(row.unitNumber)}>Open Camera Health</a></li>)}</ul></section>}</details>}
